1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,500
Little Moments.

2
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:03,281
The Homework Help Call.

3
00:00:03,281 --> 00:00:05,906
I'm staring at my notebook when Emma calls.

4
00:00:05,906 --> 00:00:08,458
She's already finished our English assignment.

5
00:00:08,458 --> 00:00:11,812
I have written exactly one word, and that word is my name.

6
00:00:12,026 --> 00:00:12,997
How's it going?

7
00:00:13,276 --> 00:00:14,551
Slowly.

8
00:00:14,551 --> 00:00:17,426
I don't understand why we need to write about a jungle.

9
00:00:17,426 --> 00:00:20,051
Our class was talking about neighborhoods today.

10
00:00:20,282 --> 00:00:21,107
A jungle?

11
00:00:21,107 --> 00:00:22,378
Which page are you on?

12
00:00:22,660 --> 00:00:23,883
Thirty-eight.

13
00:00:23,883 --> 00:00:26,497
The instructions say to describe an adventure.

14
00:00:26,497 --> 00:00:29,372
I was about to put a tiger next to the grocery store.

15
00:00:29,594 --> 00:00:31,044
We're on page eighty-three.

16
00:00:31,044 --> 00:00:34,627
Describe your neighborhood, then add one place you'd like to have nearby.

17
00:00:34,900 --> 00:00:36,581
I turn the pages.

18
00:00:36,581 --> 00:00:38,019
There it is.

19
00:00:38,019 --> 00:00:39,790
That makes more sense.

20
00:00:39,790 --> 00:00:41,508
Could you explain that again?

21
00:00:41,508 --> 00:00:43,612
Just the part about the new place.

22
00:00:43,826 --> 00:00:45,495
Write about a real place first.

23
00:00:45,495 --> 00:00:49,526
Then imagine something useful or fun, like a swimming pool or a bigger park.

24
00:00:49,526 --> 00:00:50,943
The rest is your choice.

25
00:00:51,220 --> 00:00:52,401
Thanks.

26
00:00:52,401 --> 00:00:53,818
What did you pick?

27
00:00:54,050 --> 00:00:56,292
A library with comfortable reading chairs.

28
00:00:56,292 --> 00:00:58,615
But you should choose something you actually want.

29
00:00:58,900 --> 00:01:01,685
I look out my window at the empty lot down the street.

30
00:01:01,685 --> 00:01:04,092
I would love a little basketball court there.

31
00:01:04,092 --> 00:01:06,904
I start writing before the idea disappears.

32
00:01:07,130 --> 00:01:08,090
All set now?

33
00:01:08,380 --> 00:01:09,749
I think so.

34
00:01:09,749 --> 00:01:11,342
No more jungle.

35
00:01:11,570 --> 00:01:13,905
You can save the tiger for another assignment.

36
00:01:14,188 --> 00:01:16,900
I write the page number at the top of my notebook.

37
00:01:16,900 --> 00:01:18,223
Eighty-three.

38
00:01:18,223 --> 00:01:19,932
I check it twice.

39
00:01:19,932 --> 00:01:24,119
My neighborhood already feels much safer without that tiger beside the vegetables.
